use their tool in order to maintain funding.  If you use it in your
research, please send a note to the address below.

If you haven't seen it yet, WordNet is a lexical database for English.
Its can be very useful when you are making agents like the Remembrance
Agent (actually Brad, did you end up using it for the RA?).

